<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OSTRAVA, Czech Republic 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round</p>
<p>results in the $475,000 men's Czech Open indoor tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Alex Radelescu (Germany) beat Petr Luxa (Czech Republic) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 7-5</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat Alexander Volkov (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Cristiano Caratti (Italy) beat Peter Wessels (Netherlands) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Patrick Baur (Germany) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 7-6 (11-9)</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 7-6 (7-2) 6-4</p>
</text>
